<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-22T08:19:02.412Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:19:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits are threatening to disrupt the 2027 elections in Zamfara by blockading roads and levying fees on communities, while soldiers have cleared bandits from a forest hideout in Kogi and recovered firearms. In Plateau, troops repelled a Berom militia attack on the Ruga Madaki Auwalu community and gunmen in military uniforms killed a 60-year-old security guard and wounded two others. A funeral-bound boat capsized, killing at least 24 people. Atiku Abubakar condemned a machete attack on former footballer Segun Odegbadi, and suspected herders attacked Benue communities and a military base, rescuing two women. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPamxOZTRXYVNtdm9Dc1p6RWVwc0xyLUlybi1iMU1UWF9LWnRxR21zSU9UbVlKbmZJNlNRbDlIbjBvSi12ZjVNVFktek5qY3AzakNVVF9MMjUtb3NjTzRvYVlTWDFUZ1RxWFNtSko1VGliTjBraXBDWnlQU2xzbXFlRzl0WQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Report Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNa0lNTE54elpNVWNFbHRIWGxGMWp6STA4RTZGN2pUN3MxeVRTZDBSSlRWbGlmY2JhQW1tXzVwdkRCdmllTWdNSjM4Wmh5NVBDZXh2R1VnY2w5RzBfbHRVREE2cmZVR2dheURmQjUxY0pQRmFudk9lUTFpMWJ2QVRMdWlpV3hnMlZSc2JBZg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arise News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNQ1FFUUtTTldDNGFKMGVLbFkwLXNlZ1V3cllYbVZQY2J2Mm5pT0ZDT21tLXA4RVVPUDd5b2RTSURtbFFlbndpUzRSVGhvMkVNZ0FieUo5Q08tREhzN3ZCOUo2QkZDRDd2X0NLbTlMMEo0WWJjZ0VqcmNZQmtwU01HMFdqOXd4Q3Ew?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian NewsDirect&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE0wZXg0OVd6TFdvdDFkNDVYVXBDOExJanJfdHJEeDhfTDFWU1lvT1hGakdabUNNVE9neFJQbXZTVHVkZy1sRm1SMGpfcnQwRnNwTU1weExMRGVmT3VvTFdtOThhZTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daijiworld&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NDTV&l